OL,3,GNEWSAFormer student denies university
OL,4,Acrossbow attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former University of Surrey student
OL,7,Fhas pleaded not guilty to the attempted
OL,8,Fmurder of a staff member with a
OL,9,Fcrossbow.
OL,11,FAlmunthir Daqamah, 21, is accused of
OL,12,Ftrying to kill safety officer Robert
OL,13,FTytler at the Manor Park Student
OL,14,FVillage in Guildford in June.
OL,16,FDaqamah, who appeared at Guildford
OL,17,FCrown Court on Friday via video link,
OL,18,Fis due to stand trial in January 2027.
OL,20,FStudents previously told the BBC that
OL,21,Fthey were left "very shaken" by the
OL,22,Fincident.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
